## Copy to `.env` and fill in values.
##
## ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
## Live Polymarket public APIs (Gamma / CLOB / Data)
##
## Defaults match production hosts. Override only for staging mirrors or debugging.
# POLYMARKET_GAMMA_API_URL=https://gamma-api.polymarket.com
# POLYMARKET_CLOB_API_URL=https://clob.polymarket.com
# POLYMARKET_DATA_API_URL=https://data-api.polymarket.com
# POLYMARKET_WEB_URL=https://polymarket.com
##
## Probe from the API: GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/polymarket/live/status
##
## Market list/search/get use Gamma HTTP first (fast without the Polymarket CLI).
## Set POLYMARKET_PREFER_CLI=true to restore CLI-first behavior.
# POLYMARKET_PREFER_CLI=false
##
## Kimi (Moonshot) API key:
MOONSHOT_API_KEY=your_kimi_key_here

## Optional overrides:
# ASSISTANT_PROVIDER=moonshot
# ASSISTANT_BASE_URL=https://api.moonshot.ai/v1
# ASSISTANT_MODEL=kimi-k2.5

## ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
## Live trading gate (read from `api/.env` — same file the API loads on startup)
##
## When all three are set, live orders use your Polymarket CLOB keys (SDK v2 by default)
## unless you force Bullpen with POLYMARKET_LIVE_ORDERS_VIA=bullpen.
# ENABLE_LIVE_TRADING=true
# POLYMARKET_LIVE_CONFIRM=I understand the risks of live trading.
# POLYMARKET_PRIVATE_KEY=0x_...
# POLYMARKET_FUNDER_ADDRESS=0x_...
# POLYMARKET_SIGNATURE_TYPE=0
# POLYMARKET_CLOB_SDK=v2
# POLYMARKET_CHAIN_ID=137
##
## ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
## Live trades via Bullpen CLI (optional — used when CLOB gate is off or VIA=bullpen)
##
## The API shells out to Bullpen for live execution AND account reads when POLYMARKET_USE_BULLPEN=true:
##   trades: `polymarket buy|sell|limit-*`
##   balances: `polymarket clob balance`, `positions`, `portfolio balances`
##   orders: `polymarket orders` (open / --history / --cancel)
##   fills & avg entry: `polymarket orders --history`
## This avoids broken local POLYMARKET_PRIVATE_KEY auth and matches the Bullpen web wallet.
##
## On the same machine where you run `npm run dev` in ./api:
##   1. brew install bullpenfi/tap/bullpen   (see https://cli.bullpen.fi )
##   2. bullpen login
##   3. bullpen status                       (verify “Logged in”; optional: npm run bullpen:check)
##
## If trades fail with `Turnkey` / `sign_raw_payload` / `failed to sign order`: refresh the CLI session
## (`bullpen upgrade`, `bullpen logout`, `bullpen login`) on the API host — that is remote signing, not “not installed”.
##
## The web UI must send `market_slug` + `outcome` with each trade (Signals panel already does when a slug is loaded).
##
## Explicit Bullpen execution (same as leaving POLYMARKET_LIVE_ORDERS_VIA unset with default behavior):
# POLYMARKET_LIVE_ORDERS_VIA=bullpen
##
## Use in-process CLOB instead of Bullpen (requires POLYMARKET_* keys below; more likely to hit Cloudflare from bad IPs):
# POLYMARKET_LIVE_ORDERS_VIA=clob
##
## Opt out of Bullpen for reads that also use it when unset (positions cache + balance-allowance slug path):
# POLYMARKET_USE_BULLPEN=false
##
# BULLPEN_BIN=bullpen
# BULLPEN_ENV=production
# BULLPEN_ENV=staging

## Real-money trading on Polymarket CLOB (required when POLYMARKET_LIVE_ORDERS_VIA=clob, and for open-orders / cancel / balance refresh that still use the TS CLOB client):
# POLYMARKET_PRIVATE_KEY=0x_your_wallet_private_key
# POLYMARKET_FUNDER=0x_your_polymarket_funder_address
# (alias: POLYMARKET_FUNDER_ADDRESS or FUNDER_ADDRESS)
# POLYMARKET_SIGNATURE_TYPE=0
# POLYMARKET_CHAIN_ID=137
#
## Optional: serve outcome-tape from authenticated CLOB `getTradesPaginated` (same REST as py-clob-client-v2)
## instead of the public Data API — only when the request includes `asset=<token id>` (Signals desk / tape with a token).
## See api/scripts/py_clob_tape/README.md
# POLYMARKET_RECENT_TRADES_SOURCE=clob

## Optional: IQ Option Bitcoin practice desk (Binary tab — not Polymarket)
# IQ_OPTION_EMAIL=your@email.com
# IQ_OPTION_PASSWORD=your_iq_option_password
##
## Uses IQ Option BTCX turbo binary on your practice balance. Unofficial API — can break if IQ changes their platform.

## Sanity check (Bullpen CLI + optional running API health):
#   npm run verify:live -w api
#   # or from repo root: npm run verify:live

